OL,3,CGreen councillor charged with assault
OL,4,Con five people, including police
OL,6,FA Green Party councillor in
OL,7,FBirmingham, who also ran in the West
OL,8,FMidlands mayoral election, has been
OL,9,Fcharged with assaulting five people,
OL,10,Fincluding three police officers.
OL,12,FSiobhan Harper-Nunes, 66, was arrested
OL,13,Fafter police were called to reports of
OL,14,Fa disorder in Edgbaston at around 5pm
OL,15,Fon Thursday. It was near the junction
OL,16,Fof Monument Road and Hagley Road.
OL,18,FWest Midlands Police said she was
OL,19,Finitially arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Fassault and was charged with five
OL,21,Fassault offences on Friday afternoon.
