OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786117692
OL,3,CGreen councillor charged with assault
OL,4,Con five people, including police
OL,6,FShe has been charged with assaulting a
OL,7,Fmember of the public, three police
OL,8,Fofficers and a member of police staff.
OL,10,FHarper-Nunes was elected in May to
OL,11,Frepresent Ladywood on Birmingham City
OL,12,FCouncil and previously stood as the
OL,13,FGreen Party's candidate for West
OL,14,FMidlands Mayor in 2024.
OL,16,FShe has now been suspended from the
OL,17,FGreen group on Birmingham City Council.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
