PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786117692
OL,3,CGreen councillor charged with assault
OL,4,Con five people, including police
OL,6,FA Birmingham Green Party group
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "Cllr Siobhan
OL,8,FHarper-Nunes has been suspended from
OL,9,Fthe Green Party Group with immediate
OL,10,Feffect pending an investigation."
OL,12,FLabour Group leader Cllr Nicky Brennan
OL,13,Fsaid: "She should do the right thing
OL,14,Fby the people of Ladywood and step
OL,15,Faside."
OL,17,FIn a statement, West Midlands Police
OL,18,Fsaid: "We were called to disorder near
OL,19,Fthe junction of Monument Road and
OL,20,FHagley Road at around 5pm yesterday (6
OL,21,FAugust).
