OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786117692
OL,3,CGreen councillor charged with assault
OL,4,Con five people, including police
OL,6,F"A woman was arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fassault.
OL,9,F"This afternoon, Siobhan Harper-Nunes,
OL,10,Faged 66, of Monument Road, was charged
OL,11,Fwith assaulting a member of the
OL,12,Fpublic, three police officers and a
OL,13,Fmember of police staff."
OL,15,FShe has been bailed to appear before
OL,16,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on 10
OL,17,FSeptember.
